# Research data.
#
# data/ used to be ignored wholesale, on two premises that are no longer true:
# it is not a symlink (it is a real directory), and the chat-probe captures were
# thought to contain auth tokens and cookies. A scan on 2026-08-05 found no
# cookies, bearer tokens, session keys, csrf or oauth values in them; the only
# "authorization" hits are model output about the National Defense Authorization
# Act. So the France dataset and its pinned source snapshots are now committed,
# which is what makes the SHA-256 hashes in france/build_locality_answers.py
# verifiable by anyone else.
#
# Still excluded, on size rather than secrecy.
# 49 MB of raw model completions from the Michigan pilot:
data/chat-probe/
# 29 MB all-communes research asset, carries a NOT_FOR_LOAD marker:
data/fr/offline/
# empty scaffold:
france/data/

# Claude Code session data
.claude/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.log
node_modules/
ff/src/popup/_preview.html
ff/dev/shots/

# Python artifacts and virtualenvs
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv*/
